{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35736","headline":"临川逢陈百年 · 李咸用","name":"临川逢陈百年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"麻姑山下逢真士，玄肤碧眼方瞳子。\n自言混沌凿不死，大笑老彭非久视。\n强争龙虎是狂人，不保元和虚叩齿。\n桃花雨过春光腻，劝我一杯灵液味。\n教我无爲礼乐拘，利路名场多忌讳。\n不如含德反婴儿，金玉满堂真可贵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35736.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35736","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}